"signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T05:28:10-07:00","id":1411491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1411314#post1411314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Aaah the Reptoid conspiracy theorist is like very Anti-Semite</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> A non Insiginficant number of &quot;Real world&quot; conspiracy theories that are used as the basis for Stuff like the Camarilla, Technocracy, Traditions etc are pretty solidly Antisemetic. If you can use &quot;The New World Order&quot; with a straight face you can use &quot;lizard space people&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1411318#post1411318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t usually like to get into racial politics, but why do the beautiful people have to look Nordic? Can\u2019t they be beautiful black people? Or Asian? Or even Italian?</div> </div> </div> </div>They don't.. BUT I would make the argument as Sidhe represent on some level the people in Power and not just pretty people. But that also might vary by place for example &quot;Standard&quot; kiths in Hong Kong(which are referenced in the Freehold book) seem to show up in Han chinese.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-02T20:04:05-07:00","id":1411604,"title":"","content":"There have been non-white Sidhe, we have had canon examples of Indian, Asian and black Sidhe. Are Nordics a reference to Sidhe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-03T07:20:30-07:00","id":1411637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1411604#post1411604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There have been non-white Sidhe, we have had canon examples of Indian, Asian and black Sidhe. Are Nordics a reference to Sidhe?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nordics are non sidhe but still technically changelings. The nordic sidhe are the elb from Alfheim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-03T08:17:05-07:00","id":1411643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Koronus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1411637#post1411637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nordics are non sidhe but still technically changelings. The nordic sidhe are the elb from Alfheim.</div> </div> </div> </div>No the Nordics are a class of Aliens in UFO circles. <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nordic_aliens\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nordic_aliens</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-03T14:04:08-07:00","id":1411692,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar754_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"754\" data-vbnamecard=\"754\">Eldagusto</a> oh ok. That confused me too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-05T15:32:35-07:00","id":1412172,"title":"","content":"I actually made a Kith, Offworlders, based on the beliefs of various ages in aliens. And, yeah, I have a Kith from the Inner Earth the Nockers visit also.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-05T16:44:31-07:00","id":1412186,"title":"","content":"We know there are Chimerical Aliens, we know that chimera have become Kithian, therefore we know that we can alien kiths. These kiths would vary by national geography. The English speaking world would have Greys, Nordics, and Reptilians as kiths. In much of Latin America and other places that speak romance languages, any new kith would resemble stereotypes of American pilots. In Russia and other places the Russians dominated you'd get Alien Thallain. Their UFO stories are scary nasty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-07T13:05:35-07:00","id":1412466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1411692#post1411692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar754_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"754\" data-vbnamecard=\"754\">Eldagusto</a> oh ok. That confused me too.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There are many names for them. Venusians, Plejarens, etc. A number of UFOlogist claims make reference to them coming from the Pleiades star cluster. This star cluster is important to many wold mythologies, including ones associated with Avalon and the Tuatha de Dannan. So, some Sidhe connections are not hard to make. <br /> <br /> In my home campaign, there are &quot;Stellar Trods&quot; that connect to distant stars, where anciant Umbrood/Fae Lords dwell. There are many battles in the outer dark between these great beings and Fomorian entities. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T00:19:23-07:00","id":1412692,"title":"","content":"I know a lot of UFO Mythology seems to revolve around the Pleiades. Eventually I will deep dive into it for Changeling material. I figured I would have the Stellar Sidhe be thought of as Star Children or Millennials by modern fae and ancient fae knowing them as Atlantides, with individual Houses formed for the different star clusters like Hyades, Hesperides and Pleiades.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T14:44:42-07:00","id":1412754,"title":"","content":"One thing I've noodled around with was the idea of the Void Court of Formorians who'd represent the horror of the unknown, of the darkness between the stars. There's also be some crossover between them and Nephandi with them as potential Nephandic masters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-09T23:38:44-07:00","id":1412805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1412754#post1412754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing I've noodled around with was the idea of the Void Court of Formorians who'd represent the horror of the unknown, of the darkness between the stars. There's also be some crossover between them and Nephandi with them as potential Nephandic masters.</div> </div> </div> </div>Void ain't no Colour I ever heard of! Do they sell Dark Glamour in Void?!<br /> <br /> <br /> Well I believe this already is filled in by the Green Court.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-10T17:02:21-07:00","id":1412929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1412805#post1412805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Void ain't no Colour I ever heard of! Do they sell Dark Glamour in Void?!<br /> <br /> <br /> Well I believe this already is filled in by the Green Court.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Its Vantablack<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Vantablack_02.JPG/1280px-Vantablack_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack\" target=\"_blank\"> Vantablack - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Green/red/White are clearly &quot;earthly&quot; entities. WHile I can see some crossover there.. I'm honestly thinking the more explicitly alien stuff. Even the idea of calling them the &quot;Void court&quot; is just... a convienence","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T06:37:30-07:00","id":1413001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1412929#post1412929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Its Vantablack<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Vantablack_02.JPG/1280px-Vantablack_02.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack\" target=\"_blank\"> Vantablack - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vantablack </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Green/red/White are clearly &amp;quot;earthly&amp;quot; entities. WHile I can see some crossover there.. I'm honestly thinking the more explicitly alien stuff. Even the idea of calling them the &amp;quot;Void court&amp;quot; is just... a convienence</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay that was a good answer. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Green seemed to be the mystery of the Abyss at the bottom of the see and was very Cthulhu-esque so I lumped the abyss of the deep with the abyss of the stars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-24T01:13:13-07:00","id":1415276,"title":"","content":"I collectively called mine the <b>Offworlders</b>, broken down into groups; <b><i>Da'bbah </i></b>are the oldest based on Arabic legends of other realms; <b><i>Jovians, </i></b>as many of the earliest tales of aliens from other planets focused on the moons of Jupiter or Jupiter itself; <b><i>Martians and Stellars, </i></b>the ones that largely arose in the late 1800s and early 1900s, the big difference between the two being one group is from inner planets like Mars and Venus or at least the solar system, and the other is from beyond the solar system or even galaxy (or believes they are); and <b><i>Greys, </i></b>the youngest and newest, who I don't think I need to explain. These follow different phases and beliefs, basically. I also further break them down into the Committed and Aware; Committed whole-heartedly believe they are aliens from other worlds, and are sadly often committed to institutions, while Aware recognize that they come from human ideas of what life is like on other planets. The Aware tend to be protective of the Committed.<br /> <br /> Also this:<br /> <br /> <b><u>Birthrights</u></b><br /> <b>Wierdness Armor</b> - Offworlders are the epitome of the outsider, and so are virtually never put off by the strange and unknown. As such, they never suffer from situational penalties caused by unusual circumstances; a rainstorm will bother them as much as anybody, but if that rain were to turn to frogs, it would not throw them off their stride any further. Likewise, they tend to be nonplussed by most things; they can take a hideous monster or stunning beauty in stride. They are considered to be at +2 Willpower or -2 difficulty (whichever applies) to resist fear, awe, and similar effects that play on their emotions.<br /> <br /> <b>Alien Physique</b> - The companion to their frailty, Offworlders are able to dress, live, eat, and drink in ways others find bizarre and even unsustainable. A normal human might not be able to live on a strict diet of condiments, but an Offworlder can. This Birthright lets an Offworlder use motor oil for shampoo and bathroom cleanser for toothpaste if they like without ill effects, and wear improbable outfits as if they were tailor-fitted. It lets them sleep hanging upside down or folded into a drawer. You should decide on your own Offworlder's quirks and habits and make note of them on your sheet.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Frailty</u></b><br /> <b>Otherworldly Appetites</b> - Offworlders embody the alien and unusual as seen from a human perspective. They tend to express this in unusual quirks that normal humans might find humorous or offputting. They dress in ways others don't, eat and drink things and combinations others find bizarre or disgusting, and generally are unable to just &quot;blend in.&quot; In point of fact, any time an Offworlder is forced to set aside their preferred habits to try to do so, they suffer a Banality trigger. They may also suffer from other drawbacks in the process, such as being highly uncomfortable wearing &quot;human&quot; clothing or having to eat food they consider bland or horrible. As with Alien Physique, you should decide on your Offworlder's general habits and make note on your sheet.<br /> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/xTRaiDy.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <b><u>Stereotypes</u></b><br /> Thicq and Thiin, an asexual Jovian Childling Committed and their Aware Grey Grump mentor, discuss:<br /> <br /> <b>on Boggans</b> - &quot;They're so nice, and friendly, and they never mind if I ask for more mustard in my tea.&quot; &quot;Why yes, Thicq, they're a fine lot, you can always count on them, remember that.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Clurichauns</b> - &quot;I don't like them, Thiin, they pick on me. They're mean.&quot; &quot;Don't worry, Thicq, if they call you names, I'll have my Plutonian Goose-Bear chase them off.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Eshu</b> - &quot;I love story time. I think they've been to almost as many places as you have, Thiin.&quot; &quot;Almost, Thicq, but not quite.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Nockers</b> - &quot;I don't know why you like them so, Thiin, they say such terrible things.&quot; &quot;I know Thicq, but I can't help it, all those marvelous devices make me feel very much... at home.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Piskies</b> - &quot;Mirror People from Altari-9! I didn't know they got to this part of the Galaxy, Thiin!&quot; &quot;They are a wonder, Thicq. It's so curious how they blend in. Ah, you didn't let that one into my workshop, did you?&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Pooka</b> - &quot;I wonder what planets they're from. It must be a wonderful place, all the amazing stories they tell, even more wild than the Eshu.&quot; &quot;Yes, Thicq, they are amazing, but no letting them talk you into any more adventures for a bit, okay? They don't always understand how their... views... work here.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Redcaps</b> - &quot;Sally Cyanide says she loves my mustard tea, but she thinks I should avoid her friends.&quot; &quot;Sally is right, Thicq, we'll avoid her friends unless he vouches for them.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Satyrs</b> - &quot;Thiin, what's an or-&quot; &quot;Nothing of interest, Thicq. Nothing. Of Interest. Right, friend?&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Selkies</b> - &quot;Their eyes are rather like yours. And I've been watching Blue Planet, I think where they go is very much like the oceans of Io. How I'd love to go.&quot; &quot;Yes, their eyes are... rather lovely, Thicq. I think that might be... an interesting adventure. When you're older.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Arcadian Sidhe</b> - &quot;Why are they looking at me like that, Thiin? It feels... bad.&quot; &quot;Ignore them, Thicq, they don't understand.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Autumn Sidhe</b> - &quot;But Thiin, they're GREY walkers!&quot; &quot;I'm sure they're very nice people, but we're not related.&quot; &quot;But THIIN!&quot; &quot;No, Thicq. They're not related, but... if you are lost and you see one, trust in them. The other house too.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Sluagh</b> - &quot;Look Thiin, pale Grays! I didn't know you were inviting friends over! Let's say hello!&quot; &quot;Alright, Thicq, we can invite them over. They surely are cousins of mine, and no doubt would love to meet you. Best behavior, now.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>on Trolls</b> - &quot;Hello, fellow Jovian! You're very blue, are you from Io?&quot; &quot;Thicq, that's n- never mind. Hello, friend Jovian, this is my friend Thicq, I am Thiin. I trust you will be genial with a fellow Jovian.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","user":"Windthin","date":". 09-24-2020, 04:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-24T06:35:29-07:00","id":1415294,"title":"","content":"Windthin I think you captured the concept of Alien you see in a lot of stories in a rather inspired way. It\u2019s lovey and most different from other ideas I see used for Alien Kiths, and the quote section uses an especially clever contrivance of Committed and Aware!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-15T14:41:41-08:00","id":1435588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1393266-if-new-kiths-came-to-be-couldn-t-they-be-aliens?p=1415294#post1415294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Windthin I think you captured the concept of Alien you see in a lot of stories in a rather inspired way. It\u2019s lovey and most different from other ideas I see used for Alien Kiths, and the quote section uses an especially clever contrivance of Committed and Aware!</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I got a little of K-Pax influencing, now that I mull it over. Too, when I started to really dig deep, I discovered that some of the first stories of &quot;other worlds&quot; come from Arabic culture, and ideas of alternate planes, basically. There's actually a lively debate in modern Islamic culture about the potential existence of other worlds and peoples.<br /> <br /> When I make Kiths, I remember that they're 1 part human dreams, 1 part their own thing, and the two can mesh in strange ways. I try to decide, how much of the myth is real, and how much of the myth was made real in them, and how much might they have changed on their own?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}